      "en": "Now Joshua was clothed with filthy garments, and was standing before the angel.",
      "ko": "여호수아가 더러운 옷을 입고 천사 앞에 섰는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "627ae652e83897ea93565a369f2ef2cf895ad1e4a8b5a90e991039398d61518d",
      "translation_text_hash": "b130a3196ddf6aa6d1d3b5a856640b5267221937499c5c9491a12c61d46b46ff",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호수아가 더러운 옷을 입고 천사 앞에 섰는지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b130a3196ddf6aa6d1d3b5a856640b5267221937499c5c9491a12c61d46b46ff"
